fields.help_en:
The size of the system disk for the ECS instance. Unit: GiB. Valid values: 20 to 500.

The value must be greater than or equal to max{20, `ImageSize`}.

Default value: max{40, the size of the image that corresponds to `ImageId`}

fields.help_zh:
ECS实例系统盘大小，单位为GiB。取值范围：20~500。

该参数的取值必须大于或者等于max{20, `ImageSize`}。

默认值：max{40, `ImageId`对应的镜像大小}
